{
 "_note": "rating 的 11 档(手写;gen_appstore 已漂移不能整跑,见 gen_appstore.py KEEP 注)。11 评分(68×60,card-design-system §8.2):这个 App 现在几分、多少人评过。复用 app.df(rating / cntF)。\n三行:App 名 · 分数(恒 ≤ 3 字符,20pt)+ 源色星 · 评分数。无时效锚(§8.2)。取不到 / 还没有评分:值位 `--`。",
 "rc": {
  "cells": [
   {
    "id": "bg",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "0pt",
    "y": "0pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}",
    "h": "{parent.h}",
    "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFF\\,#EEF6FF)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161A1F\\,#19202A)@90"
   },
   {
    "id": "dot",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "8pt",
    "y": "{name.y}+({name.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    },
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${name},--),--),2,0)]"
   },
   {
    "id": "dotE",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "8pt",
    "y": "{nameE.y}+({nameE.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    },
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${name},--),--),0,2)]"
   },
   {
    "id": "name",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "17pt",
    "y": "7pt",
    "w": "43pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "lineBreak": "0",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${name},--)]",
    "fontSize": "10pt",
    "typeface": "System-Bold",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${name},--),--),1,0)]"
   },
   {
    "_note": "App 名取不到时的「--」:txt 盒顶 = 墨迹顶,横线会顶到源色点上方;另起一格落到点的中线(同 tubewatch ch_dash)。",
    "id": "nameE",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "17pt",
    "y": "12.3pt",
    "w": "43pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "text": "--",
    "fontSize": "10pt",
    "typeface": "System-Bold",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${name},--),--),0,2)]"
   },
   {
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rating},--),--),0,1)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "id": "rv",
      "type": "txt",
      "x": "8pt",
      "y": "22pt",
      "w": "-1",
      "h": "-1",
      "maxLines": "1",
      "lineBreak": "0",
      "text": "${rating}",
      "fontSize": "20pt",
      "typeface": "System-Bold",
      "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
     },
     {
      "id": "star",
      "type": "path",
      "x": "{rv.r}+3pt",
      "y": "25.5pt",
      "w": "11pt",
      "h": "11pt",
      "d": "M234.29,114.85l-45,38.83L203,211.75a16.4,16.4,0,0,1-24.5,17.82L128,198.49,77.47,229.57A16.4,16.4,0,0,1,53,211.75l13.76-58.07-45-38.83A16.46,16.46,0,0,1,31.08,86l59-4.76,22.76-55.08a16.36,16.36,0,0,1,30.27,0l22.75,55.08,59,4.76a16.46,16.46,0,0,1,9.37,28.86Z",
      "viewBox": "0 0 256 256",
      "fillColor": "#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rating},--),--),1,0)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "id": "rvE",
      "type": "txt",
      "x": "8pt",
      "y": "28pt",
      "w": "54pt",
      "h": "-1",
      "maxLines": "1",
      "text": "--",
      "fontSize": "20pt",
      "typeface": "System-Bold",
      "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "cnt",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "8pt",
    "y": "46pt",
    "w": "54pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "lineBreak": "0",
    "_note": "评分数照用 app.df 的 cntF(与 22 档同一个键,一位小数的 K/M)。⚠️ 9pt × 54pt 放不下「18.7M ratings」(网页渲染台按词截成「18.7M…」;iOS 刚好放得下 —— 两端字宽不同,按窄的那端定)。所以 5 个字符起在渲染层收成整数:`18.7M` → `19M`(四舍五入)· `999.9K` → `999K`(6 字符那档截断,免得进位成 `1000K`)。cntF 是 connect 出来的字符串,length:: 判得准;round 在 Android 上返回整数。英文单位用 votes 不用 ratings:「999K ratings」收成整数后网页端仍按词截掉(实测),votes 短两个字母。",
    "text": "$[if::(ge::(length::(${cntF}),6),connect::(subString::(${cntF},0,3),K),if::(eq::(length::(${cntF}),5),connect::(round::(subString::(${cntF},0,4)),subString::(${cntF},4,5)),findNotEmpty::(${cntF},--)))] ${@i18n.ratings}",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
   }
  ],
  "i18n": {
   "zh-CN": {
    "ratings": "个评分"
   },
   "en-US": {
    "ratings": "votes"
   }
  }
 }
}
